  <dc:description>A lightweight and high-performance IPv4 address library for .NET. Provides strongly-typed IPv4 addresses, network calculations, CIDR notation support, and JSON serialization. Perfect for network programming, configuration management, and Domain-Driven Design applications.</dc:description>
